      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Go in to Pharaoh, and say to him, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of the Hebrews, “Let my people go, that they may serve me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For if you refuse to let them go and still hold them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "behold, the hand of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will fall with a very severe plague upon your cattle which are in the field, the horses, the asses, the camels, the herds, and the flocks. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will make a distinction between the cattle of Israel and the cattle of Egypt, so that nothing shall die of all that belongs to the people of Israel.” ’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " set a time, saying, “Tomorrow the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will do this thing in the land.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on the morrow the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " did this thing; all the cattle of the Egyptians died, but of the cattle of the people of Israel not one died. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Pharaoh sent, and behold, not one of the cattle of the Israelites was dead. But the heart of Pharaoh was hardened, and he did not let the people go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses and Aaron, “Take handfuls of ashes from the kiln, and let Moses throw them toward heaven in the sight of Pharaoh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall become fine dust over all the land of Egypt, and become boils breaking out in sores on man and beast throughout all the land of Egypt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they took ashes from the kiln, and stood before Pharaoh, and Moses threw them toward heaven, and it became boils breaking out in sores on man and beast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the magicians could not stand before Moses because of the boils, for the boils were upon the magicians and upon all the Egyptians. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hardened the heart of Pharaoh, and he did not listen to them; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had spoken to Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Rise up early in the morning and stand before Pharaoh, and say to him, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of the Hebrews, “Let my people go, that they may serve me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this time I will send all my plagues upon your heart, and upon your servants and your people, that you may know that there is none like me in all the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For by now I could have put forth my hand and struck you and your people with pestilence, and you would have been cut off from the earth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " but for this purpose have I let you live, to show you my power, so that my name may be declared throughout all the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are still exalting yourself against my people, and will not let them go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, tomorrow about this time I will cause very heavy hail to fall, such as never has been in Egypt from the day it was founded until now. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore send, get your cattle and all that you have in the field into safe shelter; for the hail shall come down upon every man and beast that is in the field and is not brought home, and they shall die.” ’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he who feared the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " among the servants of Pharaoh made his slaves and his cattle flee into the houses; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but he who did not regard the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " left his slaves and his cattle in the field.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Stretch forth your hand toward heaven, that there may be hail in all the land of Egypt, upon man and beast and every plant of the field, throughout the land of Egypt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses stretched forth his rod toward heaven; and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sent thunder and hail, and fire ran down to the earth. And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rained hail upon the land of Egypt; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "there was hail, and fire flashing continually in the midst of the hail, very heavy hail, such as had never been in all the land of Egypt since it became a nation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hail struck down everything that was in the field throughout all the land of Egypt, both man and beast; and the hail struck down every plant of the field, and shattered every tree of the field. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only in the land of Goshen, where the people of Israel were, there was no hail.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
