          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said to him, “As soon as I have gone out of the city, I will stretch out my hands to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; the thunder will cease, and there will be no more hail, that you may know that the earth is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
