          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as for you and your servants, I know that you do not yet fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(The flax and the barley were ruined, for the barley was in the ear and the flax was in bud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
