          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the wheat and the spelt were not ruined, for they are late in coming up.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
