          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses went out of the city from Pharaoh, and stretched out his hands to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and the thunder and the hail ceased, and the rain no longer poured upon the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when Pharaoh saw that the rain and the hail and the thunder had ceased, he sinned yet again, and hardened his heart, he and his servants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
